    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d414">

                <pb facs="0403" n="338" xml:id="pg338"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123EN3/490: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Phillips</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-12-02T11:00:00+01:00">December 2, 1936—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 2—6:55 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>501. Department’s 167, December 1, 11 a.m. In advising Foreign Office of Hughes’
                    assignment to Addis Ababa may I say orally to Count Ciano that Engert is to be
                    transferred elsewhere?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
